          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "This dashboard is designed to help you identify patches that have been approved for deployment within the SS&C WSUS environment.\n\n##### How to Use:\n1. **Set the Timeframe**: Utilize the time filter located at the top-right corner of the dashboard to specify the exact timeframe you are interested in.\n2. **Review the List**: Once the timeframe is set, the dashboard will automatically update to display a list of patches that have been approved for deployment during the selected period.\n\n\nUse the Service-Now dashboard [Windows Patching Change Controls](https://ssctech.service-now.com/sys_report_template.do?jvar_report_id=273207f51bc67154e68cb8ce034bcbca) to produce a list of changes for audit reports.",
